COPY ctl.control (control_code, name, domain, risk, rule, check_view, frequency, severity, owner_role_code, app_role_code, business_rule, is_active) FROM stdin;
SAL-01	Lead without owner or channel	SALES	Leads are not followed up and marketing ROI cannot be measured	Every open lead has a Learning Advisor and an acquisition channel	ctl.v_chk_sal_01_lead_incomplete	DAILY	MEDIUM	LA	LEARNING_ADVISOR	BR-11	t
SAL-02	Enrolment without placement test	SALES	Learners placed in the wrong level; output commitment cannot be kept	Every enrolment created from a lead has a completed placement test	ctl.v_chk_sal_02_enrolled_without_test	WEEKLY	MEDIUM	LA	LEARNING_ADVISOR	BR-11	t
BIL-01	Enrolment without payment schedule	BILLING	Tuition is never billed or followed up	Every billable enrolment has a payment schedule	ctl.v_chk_bil_01_no_schedule	DAILY	HIGH	CENTRE_MANAGER	FINANCE_MANAGER	BR-04	t
BIL-02	Schedule does not match price	BILLING	Learners are billed more or less than the agreed price	Sum of schedule lines = net payable after discounts	ctl.v_chk_bil_02_schedule_mismatch	DAILY	HIGH	CENTRE_MANAGER	FINANCE_MANAGER	BR-04	t
BIL-03	Overdue instalments	BILLING	Cash shortfall and growing bad debt	Instalments unpaid more than 30 days after due date	ctl.v_chk_bil_03_overdue	WEEKLY	HIGH	LA	LEARNING_ADVISOR	BR-06	t
BIL-04	Unapplied cash	BILLING	Receipts not linked to tuition: revenue and receivables misstated	Every issued receipt is fully allocated to instalments	ctl.v_chk_bil_04_unapplied_cash	DAILY	MEDIUM	CENTRE_MANAGER	FINANCE_MANAGER	BR-05	t
BIL-05	Discount waiting for approval	BILLING	Revenue leakage through unapproved discounts	Scholarships and discounts above 30% are approved by the Finance Manager	ctl.v_chk_bil_05_discount_policy	DAILY	HIGH	CENTRE_MANAGER	FINANCE_MANAGER	BR-04	t
BIL-06	Uncollectible balance not written off	BILLING	Receivables overstated for dropped-out learners	Earned tuition of closed enrolments is collected or written off	ctl.v_chk_bil_06_uncollectible	MONTHLY	MEDIUM	CENTRE_MANAGER	FINANCE_MANAGER	BR-06	t
